{"sections":[{"slug":"指数映射(Lie群)","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"指数映射(Lie群)"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">指数映射</span> (Lie <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>)”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“指数映射 (Lie 群)”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Lie <span lang=\"zh\">群上的指数映射是一个光滑映射</span> $\\exp\\colon \\mathfrak g\\to G$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义如下</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">对</span> $a\\in\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">令</span> $\\gamma\\colon (-\\varepsilon,\\varepsilon) \\to G$ <span lang=\"zh\">为满足方程</span> $\\gamma(0)=e$, $\\gamma'(t)=L_{\\gamma(t)}a$ ($L_{g}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为左平移</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">的曲线</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span>\n$$\r\n\\exp(a) = \\gamma(1).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">主丛上的指数映射</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">是紧</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>, $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>, $\\pi\\colon P\\to M$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $G$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/主丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">主丛</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\omega$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $P$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/联络","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">联络</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">上有</span> $\\operatorname{Ad}$-<span lang=\"zh\">不变的内积</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">从而</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">上有</span> Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">度量</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">给出了</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Haar测度","text":"Haar <span lang=\"zh\">测度</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $p\\in P$, <span lang=\"zh\">切空间</span> $T_pP$ <span lang=\"zh\">是水平空间</span> $H_pP$ (<span lang=\"zh\">等同于</span> $T_xM$) <span lang=\"zh\">与垂直空间</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">等同于</span> $\\mathfrak g$) <span lang=\"zh\">的直和</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这进一步给出了</span> $P$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">度量</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">使得二者垂直</span>. (<span lang=\"zh\">注意这个度量依赖于联络</span> $\\omega$.)</p>\n<p>$\\exp\\colon T_pP \\to \\pi^{-1}(x)$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span>\n$$\r\nj(a) = \\det \\left( \\frac{1-e^{\\operatorname{ad}a}}{\\operatorname{ad}a}\\right),\\quad j(0)=1,\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>.\n$$\r\nd(\\exp a) = j(a)\\,da.\r\n$$\n<strong><span lang=\"zh\">证明</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">由</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Duhamel公式","text":"Duhamel <span lang=\"zh\">公式</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $a,b\\in \\mathfrak g$,\n$$\r\n\\frac{d}{d\\varepsilon} \\exp(a) \\exp(a+\\varepsilon b) \\Big|_{\\varepsilon = 0} = \\frac{1-e^{\\operatorname{ad}a}}{\\operatorname{ad}a} b,\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}